<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-CANTERBURY BEAT FREE STATE 16-11.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-CANTERBURY BEAT FREE STATE 16-11.</headline>
<dateline>BLOEMFONTEIN 1997-05-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canterbury Crusaders</p>
<p>beat Free State 16-11 (halftime 10-8) in their Super 12 matchon</p>
<p>Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Free State - Try: Werner Swanepoel. Penalties: M.J. Smith</p>
<p>(2).</p>
<p>Canterbury - Try: Daryl Lilley. Conversion: Lilley.</p>
<p>Penalties: Lilley (3).</p>
</text>
